Android Remote
==============

This app includes work derived from the following projects.

androidtvremote2
  https://github.com/tronikos/androidtvremote2
  Copyright the androidtvremote2 authors. Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
  The pairing and remote-control protocol code in app/src/main/java/com/androidremote/app/tv/
  (Framing.kt, PairingClient.kt, PairingSecret.kt, RemoteClient.kt, RemoteProtocol.kt,
  CertSubject.kt and the chunking in Voice.kt) is a Kotlin port of its Python implementation
  (base.py, pairing.py, remote.py, androidtv_remote.py), ported from commit
  387de891bd7d0cacf44ede7841470db153c53009.
  app/src/main/proto/polo.proto and remotemessage.proto are copied from it;
  remotemessage.proto has two Java options added.

Google TV pairing protocol
  https://android.googlesource.com/platform/external/google-tv-pairing-protocol/
  Copyright 2009 Google Inc. Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
  polo.proto originates from this project.

androidtv-remote
  https://github.com/louis49/androidtv-remote
  Copyright (c) 2021 louis49. Licensed under the MIT License (text below).
  remotemessage.proto and the OuterMessage change in polo.proto originate from this project.

Material Symbols
  https://github.com/google/material-design-icons
  Copyright Google LLC. Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
  The icon paths in app/src/main/java/com/androidremote/app/ui/icons/Icons.kt are copied
  from Material Symbols (Rounded).

